From: thor2002ro <thor2002ro@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] Local: avcodec: add JPEG and MJPEG V4L2 decoding

Decode 8-bit sequential JPEG and MJPEG with requests or direct M2M queues.
Preserve frame geometry, stream tables, and packet metadata.

Signed-off-by: thor2002ro <thor2002ro@gmail.com>
